# Performance

## Widgets

- `const` on every widget that accepts no dynamic data
- `const` constructors on token/color classes
- `ListView.builder` / `GridView.builder` for lists with > 3 items
- Avoid `Column`/`Row` with many `if` expressions — use conditional lists

## State

- No `setState` for global state — use BLoC
- Use `BlocSelector` / `BlocBuilder`'s `buildWhen` to limit rebuilds

## Images

- Use `cached_network_image` with explicit `width`/`height`
- Set `memCacheWidth` for large images

## Layout

- No `MediaQuery.of(context)` in build — use `ScreenUtil` globals or `AppSpacing`
- `addPostFrameCallback` only when absolutely necessary

## Memory

- Cancel stream subscriptions in `dispose()`
- Close `TextEditingController`, `FocusNode`, `ScrollController` in `dispose()`
